# Windows script files must keep CRLF.
#
# cmd.exe mis-parses LF-only .cmd and .bat files, and the failure is
# misleading: it reports something unrelated, such as a broken interpreter
# path, rather than a line-ending problem. Git would otherwise normalise these
# to LF on checkout and the launcher would stop working for reasons nobody
# could see in the file.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
